{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123043004233-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123080016\"/><p>落馬洲發生傷人案。今日(23日)清晨4時22分，執法部門接獲一名男子報案，指位於青山公路-米埔段住所外，遭3名男子襲擊，其中一人更手持利刀向其施襲，惡漢逞兇後逃去。</p><p>人員接報到場，發現姓陳(34歲)男子手及腳部受傷，他清醒被送往博愛醫院治理，警員正調查兇徒犯案動機。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:53.011716+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T20:30:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:57:13.818370+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:47.924607+00:00","content_hash":"5f09892b3519fc6c8e41ead0ae76f61e6224cf3603e519b8b667b1754319e0f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:53.011716+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}